    dayInLife_zh:
      '早上打开 After Effects，继续打磨一个 App 的页面转场动画。这个弹出效果的弹性参数调了十几版了，差一点就"过"了，再收一点又"闷"了——追求那个恰好的"活"感。\n\n上午和开发对接动效参数，把每一帧的关键帧数据导出成 Lottie 文件。看到工程师在真机上跑出来的效果和我在 AE 里做的一模一样，成就感爆棚。午饭后研究竞品的微交互，录屏然后逐帧分析别人的缓动曲线。\n\n下午做一个产品宣传视频的动态分镜，把品牌的视觉语言变成有节奏感的运动。配上音乐，在时间轴上一帧一帧地对齐节拍。最后渲染出来回看的时候，所有的辛苦都值了——画面在呼吸。',
    dayInLife_en:
      'Morning in After Effects, polishing a page transition animation for an app. I\'ve iterated the spring parameters a dozen times — a hair too bouncy feels "extra," a touch less feels "dead." Chasing that sweet spot of *alive*.\n\nI sync animation specs with the dev team, exporting keyframe data as Lottie files. Seeing the effect run on a real device exactly as I designed it in AE — pure joy. After lunch, I study competitor micro-interactions, screen-recording and analyzing their easing curves frame by frame.\n\nAfternoon: dynamic storyboarding for a product promo video, translating brand language into rhythmic motion. Laying it over music, aligning frame by frame to the beat. When the final render plays back and the visuals breathe — every painstaking hour was worth it.',
